      "text": "Both now and ev---er, and un-to the ag-es of ag-es. A-men.\n\nO_ Sav-iour, by Thy Moth-er’s_ prayers, of all Thy mar-tyrs slain for Thee, the a-pos---tles, proph-ets, hi-erarchs, and the just, the right-eous, and of all the Saints, grant rest un-to Thy ser--vants that have re-posed, O Sov-’reign Mas-ter Christ.___"
